Subject: [RFC/RFT v2 12/14] arm64: dts: meson-g12a: enable DVFS on G12A boards
Date:   Wed, 26 Jun 2019 11:06:30 +0200
Message-Id: <20190626090632.7540-13-narmstrong@baylibre.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.21.0
